# Models SQLite

- Dataset menyimpan path file + JSON validasi, bukan bar M1.
- `BacktestRun.status`: queued, running, done, failed.
- `params` dan costs di JSONField / kolom skalar seperti CONVERSION_PLAN.md.
- Trade, MetricSet, WalkForwardFold, RobustnessRow, MonteCarloSummary, DecisionGate, ExportFile.
- EquityPoint di-downsample jika terlalu panjang.
- Jangan simpan 10k kurva Monte Carlo.

Index FK `run` pada tabel anak.
